cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "specsrbench: benchmarking deep learning against classical deconvolution for galaxy spectral super-resolution"
abstract: >-
  Seven classical deconvolution methods benchmarked against a deep-learning
  super-resolution pipeline on 572 held-out JWST/NIRSpec prism spectra from
  JADES, with the four guards needed to keep mean absolute error from rewarding
  a method that reconstructs badly.
